  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "The engine, idle quality and acceleration was also excellent. The transmission shifts well through all the gears, and there were no abnormal noises or vibrations, felt or heard during the road test. When I scanned the vehicle's computer, I found no fault codes that were currently active."
